Inject a TrifoolPercent hook call at the top of KaleidoScope_DrawQuestStatus so
Beat 2.1 can equip a medallion to a C-button when Sages' Charm is held. The
hook body is in soh/Enhancements/TrifoolPercent/Beat2_1MedallionOnC.cpp; when
the feature CVar is off (or the Charm is not held) it is a no-op early return,
so an engine binary carrying this patch with the mod disabled behaves exactly
like vanilla.

Upstream parallel: scripts/statics/interface.c:128 Statics_HandleEquipMedallionsToC
